.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T23:23:56-07:00","id":173757,"title":"","content":"you and me both, brother!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T08:32:48-07:00","id":175260,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in a Skype game but not for another month.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T00:32:28-07:00","id":175845,"title":"","content":"I would be interested in a Skype game, but not a long one. School starts again on August 15th, and after that I'm just too busy. Playing once or twice a week still leaves plenty of time, though. GMT+2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T13:23:52-07:00","id":176337,"title":"","content":"If everyone is still interested in a month I can run one in about a months time. We'd play once a week on weekends (the day and time being the median of all the players) on a day that fits everyone's schedule.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T15:04:37-07:00","id":176451,"title":"","content":"I'm totally down. Message me when you're able.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T07:47:07-07:00","id":184817,"title":"","content":"I've already got a Blood and Smoke game going with my current local group on Saturday afternoons (GMT +1) but as the ever Storyteller... I want to play. I'm gonna keep myself in this thread and see how it goes. Put me down for a maybe? :-D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T23:12:15-07:00","id":189211,"title":"","content":"Is this thread still looking for players in a Demon: the Descent Chronicle? If so I've always wanted to try a Skype game, and my scheduled in the foreseeable future is very open.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T11:29:29-07:00","id":190538,"title":"","content":"Doesn't seem like there's much love for this at the moment... but since my VtR group has been dismantled (life gets in the way, what can you do) I find myself with a lot of free time. Not enough free time to <i>plan </i>a DtD game, but certainly enough to put 100% into whatever character I end up making. <br /> <br /> Who's up for GM'ing this bad boy?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T15:12:01-07:00","id":190783,"title":"","content":"I haven't run a Chronicle using the GMC rules update yet or for that matter Role Played over Skype yet. But, that said I have successfully run a Changeling: the Lost Chronicle and I'll be Skype RPing with some friends this weekend regardless, so if I had plenty of time to read up on the material and got a good beat on Skype I feel confident I could run a most excellent Demon: the Descent Chronicle. I love all things God Machine related and have quite a few ideas i'd like to try.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T18:32:56-07:00","id":190994,"title":"","content":"I am still up for running a skype game starting in about 2 weeks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T18:39:57-07:00","id":190999,"title":"","content":"I tend to play very rules-lite chronicles and other games, so don't expect me to be good at system mastery or anything, but I might be interested?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T19:10:48-07:00","id":191015,"title":"","content":"This is good, as of right now we have at least five people interested in a Skype game and two of them, myself included, are open to being Storyteller. I'm still new to Skype and the rules revision though so if <b>Xiongrey</b> would prefer to ST then I'm fine waiting two weeks to figure out how to use Skype efficiently and study the rules revision more thoroughly in the meantime.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T22:22:01-07:00","id":191124,"title":"","content":"I'd love to play in this one so I'm in! Would anyone taking part be opposed to meeting up on Skype beforehand so that we can introduce ourselves?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":933,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","user":"shadowhowler","date":". 07-08-2014, 01:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T04:48:58-07:00","id":191301,"title":"","content":"If the times are reasonable I'd also like in on this... though I may suggest.. we can use Roll20.net to handle dice and such.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T04:51:40-07:00","id":191303,"title":"","content":"If we're on Skype, though, could we not use our own dice and roll them before the camera? That's kinda how I thought it would go given the visual element is actually present unlike in PBP games. Besides, no RNG can successfully match the feel of a set of dice rolling across a table :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T09:35:28-07:00","id":191472,"title":"","content":"That requires everyone to have a camera to angle that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T14:49:14-07:00","id":191706,"title":"","content":"Alright, this now brings us up to six potential players. Lets just keep each other posted on this thread and wait and see how <b>x</b><b>iongrey</b> would like to run this. I think I'll keep a tally of all available players so if something comes up or I get my info wrong please let me know.<br /> <br /> Current Tally:<br /> <br /> Storyteller: <b>x</b><b>iongrey</b><br /> <br /> players: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Dusksage</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, <b>shadowhowler</b>, and <b>Windrave</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T14:55:25-07:00","id":191712,"title":"","content":"Yep, seems good to me! And now we play the waiting game...<br /> <br /> Anyone got any character ideas yet? I must admit I'm a little lost in the massive ocean of possibilities. We don't yet have a defined setting, but that shouldn't really matter to our pre-Fall identities (i.e. Incarnations and the mission that served as the catalyst for our fall?); maybe we can even make things easy for our ST by coming up with linked backgrounds so that we're not complete strangers :-) <br /> <br /> Also, fair point - is anyone considering playing a Demon-Blooded from Heirs to Hell? From what I see they're almost an encouraged character type!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T16:19:40-07:00","id":191776,"title":"","content":"I lack a camera, so if that's the case, I'm out. I'm down for text over Skype but thoroughly uninterested in being over mic/video.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T17:42:20-07:00","id":191853,"title":"","content":"<b>shadowhowler</b>, that's a fantastic idea. I actually have a character idea for Demon that's been lying around that would fun to try:<br /> <br /> A Psychopomp/Integrator called Mr. Door who's Cover is a freelance photographer called Vance P. Adams. Before the Fall he oversaw a Logistical Infrastructure that consisted of seven blown up photographs that served as portals to the location where the picture was taken. He Fell when he grew to fascinated with the worlds that his Infrastructure led to and went through one of them and was thus disconnected from the God Machine. He's chooses the Integrator Agenda because his journey back from the other world was filled with the fear of the unknown and the humbling realization of how weak he was by himself. His want to rejoin the God Machine so that he can again have access to his former powers and influence but he loves his new found freewill to much to give it up, so he intends to find a means of become an Exile so he can have the best of both world and no longer fear the unknown.<br /> <br /> What do you guys think?<br /> <br /> P.S. <b>atamajakki</b>, I haven't heard back from <b>xiongrey</b> yet so I think our means of RPing is still open for debate. I hope that everyone'll be able to participate though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T22:32:17-07:00","id":192030,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm not a cam guy either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T22:35:19-07:00","id":192033,"title":"","content":"I'm also still interested. My schedule has cleared up, so I would be available, if it's not in the middle of the night GMT-wise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T22:52:46-07:00","id":192045,"title":"","content":"Alright, in that case lets amend the tally accordingly. <br /> <br /> Current Tally:<br /> <br /> Storyteller: <b>x</b><b>iongrey</b><br /> <br /> players: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Dusksage</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, <b>shadowhowler</b>, <b>TelperionST</b>, and <b>Windrave</b><br /> <br /> webcam unavailable: <b>atamajakki</b>, and <b>Epshy</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T22:53:34-07:00","id":192046,"title":"","content":"Ya'll really should try Roll20.. its multipurpose and does have format options for wod style dice rolling... it can also hold character sheets.. though currently I think they're set to D&amp;D... but theres a plain text entry that works just as well... and you can build macros for dice rolls... etc. it also supports cam and voice.<br /> <br /> No downloads required as it operates off a webpage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T22:58:16-07:00","id":192047,"title":"","content":"I'm sure we'll find a place to play on and a medium that suits us all- if not the majority. Personally I just came from a pen and paper tabletop game and I really wouldn't like to give all that up in favour for the totally electronic. Sure, the God-Machine is a machine, but it's also a physical entity ;-) So I vote for webcam/ having the option of being able to have my printed character sheet/ special WoD dice (which I hunted down tirelessly for) in front of me! I'll post a character idea up later (typing on an iPhone sucks!) but thanks for getting the party started Dusksage! Let's all discuss our character ideas even if we can't all agree on how/ when/ where to play this game! (For some reason iPhones also can't throw in line breaks so I apologise if the post looks a little wonky!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":933,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","user":"shadowhowler","date":". 07-09-2014, 02:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:07:51-07:00","id":192080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=192045#post192045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">webcam unavailable: <b>atamajakki</b>, and <b>Epshy</b></div> </div> </div> </div>I actually don't have a webcam either. Is this a problem? I could get one since they aren't exactly expensive. I just don't have any use for a webcam, really.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:08:59-07:00","id":192082,"title":"","content":"Do you have an iPad? iPhone? Android? I was planning on using a tablet for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:13:33-07:00","id":192085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowhowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=192082#post192082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have an iPad? iPhone? Android? I was planning on using a tablet for this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have an iPad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:15:56-07:00","id":192086,"title":"","content":"Awesome! Skype is free on that, you've got your camera, and you're portable! Not to mention the video quality on these things compared to traditional webcams.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:16:58-07:00","id":192087,"title":"","content":"(Chalk me up as a 'maybe,' not a 'yes').<br /> <br /> I've been in a rules-lite Changeling chronicle for a few months now, and we use Skype with multiple rooms (one OOC, several IC); it's all text, and works like a dream. <br /> <br /> If I end up in this, I'm thinking of playing Alphonse. He's a Messenger/Inquisitor whose Cover was a vague government agent who dispatched missives to mortal servants of the Machine. When one of the agents didn't follow through on the delivered instructions, Alphonse took it upon himself to investigate what precisely had gone wrong and found the man had committed suicide rather than continue killing for an alien god. The realization of that grim tableau - <i>service is a choice</i> - caused him to Fall. Now Unchained, his purpose remains similar to it was when he was an Angel; he gather intelligence and delivers it to those more suited to field work. He's fragile, pragmatic, and somewhat cowardly, but thoroughly dedicated to the cause and eager to see the best in people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:26:52-07:00","id":192097,"title":"","content":"I think, maybe, we should figure out what everyone's time zone is so that we can get an idea of what kind of game hours were talking about. Having a webcam/ the tabletop experience is great, but I've got a wife and child and I don't think they'd appreciate me being on webcam at 4 in the morning... I'm currently GMT + 1 (+ a further 1 for Summer Time).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:28:27-07:00","id":192100,"title":"","content":"PST. I don't remember what that is in GMT; -8, I think?<br /> <br /> Skype (sorry for pushing this so hard, it just works super well!) is great for disparate timezones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:31:12-07:00","id":192101,"title":"","content":"It's 11:29pm on the pacific coast, 8:29am here in the Mediterranean, so we're already 9 hours apart lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:32:53-07:00","id":192102,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowhowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=192101#post192101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's 11:29pm on the pacific coast, 8:29am here in the Mediterranean, so we're already 9 hours apart lol.</div> </div> </div> </div>9:32am over here in Scandinavia, so we are not that far apart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:34:25-07:00","id":192104,"title":"","content":"Nevermind! Says on your profile lol. I was gonna guess Sweden!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:49:34-07:00","id":192109,"title":"","content":"This is great, we can start working on interpersonal relations between the Ringmates the more information we post about them. For instance I got the interactive Demon: the Descent character sheets so I already have Mr. Door written up. The Embeds and Exploits I've got written down now are: Embeds - Authorized, Idle Conversation, Synthesis. Exploits - Rip the Gates.<br /> I can see Mr. Door working with Alphonse as sort of a pathfinder, using his embeds to make sure he reaches his destination on time and efficiently, or collaborating with him to scout out Infrastructure, since an Inquisitor's insight into the interworkings of the Machine and an Integrator's understanding of the Angelic psyche would be priceless when combined.<br /> <br /> Current Tally:<br /> <br /> Storyteller: <b>x</b><b>iongrey</b><br /> <br /> players: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Dusksage</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, <b>shadowhowler</b>, <b>TelperionST</b>, and <b>Windrave</b><br /> <br /> webcam unavailable: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, and <b>TelperionST</b>*<br /> <br /> * Situation Pending","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:52:01-07:00","id":192116,"title":"","content":"Crap, I forgot about the time difference. It's 11:59 pm on the California coast right now, would anyone know how that would translate?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:52:23-07:00","id":192117,"title":"","content":"You know, Dusksage, no Roleplay group is a group without an excellent scribe--the person who keeps track of things, writes stuff down, etc. I wish I had you in my group. Haha! My character concept is coming, I swear, I'm just still deciding! :-O","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:55:45-07:00","id":192122,"title":"","content":"So two of you guys on the Pacific coast, two of us all the way on the other side of the Atlantic. God I love telecommunications! We'll make it work. 8/9pm here is about 12pm for you guys over there. That's how it'll have to work, I guess. One part of the group playing through lunch, the other through dinner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T00:05:15-07:00","id":192130,"title":"","content":"Scribe...I like the sound of that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T00:06:05-07:00","id":192131,"title":"","content":"This sort of things tends to work better if it's less &quot;let's all somehow be online all at once and do a scene for a few hours&quot; and more &quot;post when you can and kind of have the chronicle run itself.&quot; Not trying to backseat Storyteller, but the latter has worked beautifully while the former has failed countless times in my experience. Something to consider, I suppose.<br /> <br /> Maybe we should make a skype group instead of clogging up the forums here?<br /> <br /> I don't have Alphonse's sheet on hand at the moment, but I know he had Authorized, Merciless Gunman, and Voice of the Machine, and that the fourth power wasn't an Exploit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T00:08:14-07:00","id":192133,"title":"","content":"Sure, that sounds good to me matey :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T00:11:56-07:00","id":192137,"title":"","content":"My Skype username is atamajakki, same as on here. Just tell me who you are!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T00:21:40-07:00","id":192158,"title":"","content":"I hope I didn't just add some random person lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T05:15:14-07:00","id":192286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=192109#post192109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">webcam unavailable: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, and <b>TelperionST</b>*<br /> <br /> * Situation Pending</div> </div> </div> </div>I now have a 720p webcam, which is sufficient for our needs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","user":"TelperionST","date":". 07-09-2014, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T07:27:09-07:00","id":192388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=190994#post190994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am still up for running a skype game starting in about 2 weeks.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm up for playing message me with your skype name and I will be good to go","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T07:32:13-07:00","id":192391,"title":"","content":"I hope their is still room for me to play would be kind of sucky if not.<br /> <br /> iI can use webcam but rater not. I have a skype dice roller for NWOD. I also made a character I can make a new one if it does not fit your game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 07-09-2014, 10:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T09:43:14-07:00","id":192481,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure about how much room there is given that our ST hasn't really said how many he's willing to handle. Although given that already half of us are divided by 9+ hours of time zone it may be difficult for all of us to meet at the same time. Not that I'm volunteering, but we may need to consider a duo-storyteller game or maybe a PBP (when you can) kind of game. Never really handled this kinda time difference before, so I don't really know; just guessing <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> p.s. I'm happy to assist with rules checking and whatnot since I know the game quite well, though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T12:04:14-07:00","id":192609,"title":"","content":"would kind of suck that I created the thread then don't get it in lol.<br /> <br /> Yea I'm not into play by post way to slow.<br /> <br /> Yea I'm in the EST time zone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T12:19:58-07:00","id":192616,"title":"","content":"Subscribe to the thread, that way you'll get email notifications as we post. It's kind of exploded today so I guess you've just been left behind!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T13:05:31-07:00","id":192646,"title":"","content":"Well, I say the more the merrier. If the group gets to big we can just split the whole group in to two Rings so no one would have to stay up/wake up at odd hours of the day. Perhaps the rings could be a part of the same Demon Agency?<br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Current Tally:<br /> <br /> Storyteller: <b>x</b><b>iongrey</b><br /> <br /> players: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Basic</b>, <b>Dusksage</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, <b>shadowhowler</b>, <b>TelperionST</b>, and <b>Windrave</b><br /> <br /> webcam unavailable: <b>atamajakki</b>, and <b>Epshy</b></span><br /> </span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T13:19:00-07:00","id":192672,"title":"","content":"Or, to make things more interesting, these two proposed rings could be their <i>own </i>(albeit small) Agency. I guess it depends on how many demonic NPCs are gonna be present in the game and if there will be enough to populate the myriad of Agency types available. We could be an Agency in charge of our own affairs, all of the drama can happen within. Maybe a few NPCs can populate its higher ranks so we can still be given &quot;jobs&quot; to do, or maybe we can make our own jobs?<br /> <br /> Alternatively, both rings could be part of different--or even competing--Agencies. I'm a big fan of drama, and an even bigger fan of bringing that drama home and focusing it around the protagonists and as few other people as possible. <br /> <br /> Anyone got a third alternative, just to provide as many ideas as possible?<br /> <br /> I do think, though, that two Rings may require two storytellers. I don't think <b>xiongrey </b>would want to be controlling two groups at different times. Anyone feel confident enough to take on the challenge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T13:40:15-07:00","id":192697,"title":"","content":"I have experience with regular tabletop, play-by-chat and play-by-post. I'm also one of those STs that likes to take his time building a setting, creating memorable NPCs, iterating over the same one-page length summary of a story arc time and time again, building subplots, creating relationship charts...you probably get the idea. So, I could do this, but I would never consider letting any player near my material before about 6 months from now. Anything less would feel rushed and incomplete, which leads to an unhappy ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T13:48:59-07:00","id":192707,"title":"","content":"You and me both my friend! I really wish the group I had here were the kinds of people who would appreciate all that work, but I ended up mostly just running auto-pilot games which ended up being pretty shallow. Intrigue went way over my group's heads and mysteries often went unsolved unless there was an NPC around to fill in the blanks. They weren't even tough mysteries either! <br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll help the ST out in whatever way possible without actually BEING the ST :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T13:53:47-07:00","id":192728,"title":"","content":"I've been the exclusive Storyteller for my group for five years and I'm about to start my Arkham Lost chronicle, so I'm afraid I'm in no shape to co-ST.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T14:07:50-07:00","id":192741,"title":"","content":"I could do it, I've run a successful Changeling: the Lost game before. I'd just really miss playing in the chronicle though, I've wanted to play a Demon ever since I backed it on Kickstarter. But I could do it, and it would be great. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Storyteller: <b>Dusksage</b>*, <b>x</b><b>iongrey</b><br /> <br /> players: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Basic</b>, <b>Dusksage</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, <b>shadowhowler</b>, <b>TelperionST</b>, and <b>Windrave</b><br /> <br /> webcam unavailable: <b>atamajakki</b>, and <b>Epshy</b><br /> <br /> * Situation Pending","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T16:23:00-07:00","id":192881,"title":"","content":"I heard back from<b> xiongrey</b> a little while ago. It looks like there shall be only one ST for this Chronicle and it'll be <b>xiongrey</b>. This works for me though since now I can resume my role as player.<br /> <br /> <br /> Current Tally:<br /> <br /> Storyteller: <b>x</b><b>iongrey</b><br /> <br /> players: <b>atamajakki</b>, <b>Basic</b>, <b>Dusksage</b>, <b>Epshy</b>, <b>shadowhowler</b>, <b>TelperionST</b>, and <b>Windrave</b><br /> <br /> webcam unavailable: <b>atamajakki</b>, and <b>Epshy</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T16:28:18-07:00","id":192883,"title":"","content":"Could you pass word on to xiongrey about joining the skype group we've got going on now? I think Shadowhowler and Telperion are already in it. We're just using it to chat about the chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T18:16:12-07:00","id":192940,"title":"","content":"<b>Ok</b>, i'll be sure to pass it on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T20:10:22-07:00","id":193049,"title":"","content":"Can some one add me on skype to the chat my skype is basic204","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T23:13:26-07:00","id":193201,"title":"","content":"Quick question on character creation: can we use material from Flowers of Hell?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T23:18:59-07:00","id":193202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TelperionST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=193201#post193201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick question on character creation: can we use material from Flowers of Hell?</div> </div> </div> </div> That's an odd question no? It's a players guide and you're a player. I can't imagine &quot;no&quot; being the answer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T23:51:24-07:00","id":193219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowhowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=193202#post193202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> That's an odd question no? It's a players guide and you're a player. I can't imagine &quot;no&quot; being the answer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>In my opinion any material outside a core book is optional based on ST fiat. Demon doesn't have a lot of books out yet, but if you are familiar with game lines like Mage: the Awakening then the concept of power creep should be all too familiar. There's some really game breaking material out there for an industrious player to find, so I always ask.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T00:01:00-07:00","id":193226,"title":"","content":"Fair enough, but if I've paid the $20 for a book to use in a game I'd expect to be allowed to use it and then be moderated should I be showing signs of power-creepness. Of course, I'd expect a fair hearing and solid justification for any objection. I can't remember the last time I had a game which a player &quot;broke&quot; because he had some awesome abilities and we all had a great time as a result <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, Mage is my favourite game and I've run it pretty consistently since it's release. It really is a case of simply moderating &quot;problem&quot; players instead of dampening everyone's choices. That works far better for morale, IMHO.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T00:03:48-07:00","id":193227,"title":"","content":"Having said, my players never bought their own books anyway so they always ended up asking lol!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T10:36:27-07:00","id":193779,"title":"","content":"We don't even have an ST and you're inquiring about CC rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T10:43:06-07:00","id":193785,"title":"","content":"I moderate a gaming forum focused around WoD games. Here's the address if you're interested: <a href=\"http://calloftea.com/forum/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://calloftea.com/forum/index.php</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T11:00:15-07:00","id":193791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173704-looking-for-an-online-demon-the-decent-game?p=193779#post193779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We don't even have an ST and you're inquiring about CC rules?</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought <b>xiongrey</b> said he will ST the game? At least that was the message I read yesterday. Anyway, if the game starts in a couple of weeks, then I think now would be a good idea to ask about character creation rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T11:22:02-07:00","id":193799,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Here's a character concept for the game:<br /> <br /> Mr. Serpent is a Destroyer / Inquisitor whose Cover is a surveillance technician called Erik Pratt whose job it is to install, fix or upgrade existing surveillance equipment. Serpent was programmed time and again to eliminate demons: capture and return to an Infrastructure designed to disassemble and deprogram. Somewhere along the way bits of programming started to get corrupted. Emotions of frustration and murderous desire started intruding on Serpent\u2019s missions, because would it not be more effective to utterly destroy these fallen angels? So, he killed and fell. The emotional pain that followed his actions devastated the newly fallen demon. He fell back to finding an inner calm through finding a personal Hell. Serpent doesn\u2019t kill anymore. Period. He is still capable of advocating violence, though.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","user":"TelperionST","date":". 07-10-2014, 02:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T14:35:08-07:00","id":193986,"title":"","content":"<b>TelperionST</b>, did you make an Antinomian Destroyer? I've never actually seen someone do that before, and it's pretty awesome! I can't wait to see how Mr. Serpent would use Cacophony Embeds in a non-lethal manner. Plus that makes the Ring two Inquisitors and one Integrator so far which shouldn't be to hard to come up with a reason why they're working together, like if they were all trying to gather intelligence on a particular Angel that's been troubling their Agency or a mysterious new Infrastructure that seemingly appeared over night without warning.<br /> <br /> P.S. This is a super late response to<b> atamajakki</b> but I actually missed what was said at the bottom of a post a while back but: Rip the Gates is so totally an Exploit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T15:24:54-07:00","id":194024,"title":"","content":"My concept is to come: will write it up here tomorrow. I've decided on a Messenger/ Saboteur character named Mercury. Should fit in nicely with the rest of the ring, I reckon <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T16:31:38-07:00","id":194093,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty Fluent in Skype especially for Demon games. I would be up for playing a character as well if <b>Dusksage</b> wants to ST. I only have to wait till this coming Tuesday (payday!) and I can start.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T16:45:46-07:00","id":194098,"title":"","content":"I know it's a Double post but seeing as how this is ramping up, I might as well use my brother's computer for the time being till this Tuesday when I can finally replace my dead computer.<br /> <br /> The More the Merrier is right. The more there is the better the &quot;multi-chat&quot; system works (which is the best way i've found to run Demon games)...Thank you Ryu for that.<br /> <br /> Camera/voice will be optional, I personally have a camera in my laptop but it doesn't need to get used. The main medium for storytelling will be text.<br /> <br /> Roll20 is pretty good but honestly <a href=\"http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> is the best group dice roller that i've come across for skype nWoD games.<br /> <br /> Can we get a tally of who is in which timezone?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\">\u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I thought <b>xiongrey</b> said <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">she</span> will ST the game? At least that was the message I read yesterday. Anyway, if the game starts in a couple of weeks, then I think now would be a good idea to ask about character creation rules. </div> </div> </div></div> <br /> Correction in <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">red.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T16:56:42-07:00","id":194102,"title":"","content":"I would prefer that you took the reigns on this Chronicle <b>xiongrey</b>. I'm still not used to Skype enough yet to feel confident about technical issues, although I am comfortable enough with my Storyteller skills to say that any Chronicle I make will be pretty fine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, and this would give me a good opportunity to learn without jeopardizing the game.<br /> <br /> As for time zones I know for a fact that at least two of use, myself being one of them, is Pacific Northwest Coast for USA. As for the rest I have no idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T16:57:05-07:00","id":194103,"title":"","content":"I'm in PST, which I think is GMT-8. California reporting in. xiongrey (and everyone else; I've got Shadowhowler, Telperion, and basic), add me on skype so I can get y'all in the chat. Same username as here.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T17:35:50-07:00","id":194139,"title":"","content":"Right On, I'm in Washington so I'm GMT-8 as well. I'll add everyone when I get home tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank