>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T00:48:04-07:00","id":209180,"title":"","content":"That's the thing, I've tried that at least 3 times by now. I've even restarted and turned off my computer multiple times. No matter what I try it just won't re-install the program<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T00:50:15-07:00","id":209181,"title":"","content":"I don't know what to say. System restore is what I would do. <br /> <br /> Start &gt; Accessories &gt; System Tools &gt; System Restore.<br /> <br /> The prompt is easy to follow. Pick a date, maybe yesterday or the day before, and the Laptop will do the rest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T00:50:59-07:00","id":209183,"title":"","content":"Ok, i'll give it one more shot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","us